vX.Y.Z (YYYY-MM-DD)

- shellcheck linting
- Fix undefined error function in the PostgreSQL database report generator and
  require the database name to be set with -d
- Exclude pg_catalog indexes from the per-metric pages of the PostgreSQL index
  report, matching the per-index pages
- Exit successfully from -h in the PostgreSQL report generators and tighten
  the sed expressions that derive metric names from chart file names
- Fix transaction filter expression in the R transaction rate plot script
- Clean up temporary file handling in the gnuplot plot scripts: remove a stray
  import of an empty file, quote log file names on import, and remove
  temporary files on interruption
- Fix the Julia transaction rate plot script to average per-minute counts
  when charting transactions per second, matching the gnuplot and R versions
- Make the gnuplot, R, and Julia transaction plot scripts chart the same
  thing: elapsed minutes since the earliest logged event on the x-axis, and
  tps averaged over the seconds a minute actually covers so partial minutes
  are not undercounted
- Create the output directory in the Julia plot scripts like the gnuplot and
  R versions do
- Move the private Julia package depot from a fixed /tmp path to a per-user
  cache directory so concurrent users do not collide
- Add -h flag to dbt-plot and use POSIX command -v instead of which in
  dbt-plot and dbt-version
- Fix typos in usage messages and comments, and use "Transactions per" on
  rate chart y-axis labels in every language

v0.5.1 (2024-07-31)

- Average transaction per second rate charts over a minute to be more readable
  over longer time spans

v0.5.0 (2023-04-23)

- Update reports to use touchstone-tools for system and process stat charts
- Remove option to set output directories and instead base the output directory
  on where the input files are
- Require the database name to be set when generating the postgresql report
- Remove R and Julia sar and pidstat plotting scripts in favor of
  touchstone-tools gnuplot versions
- Add gnuplot versions of transaction plotting scripts

v0.4.1 (2023-03-01)

- Add "version" script to show kit version and versions of software that may be
  used

v0.4.0 (2023-02-24)

- Add dates to releases.
- Add Julia versions of each plotting script
- Add network plot for device % utilization
- Remove original HTML generating report scripts
- More shellcheck linting

v0.3.2 (2023-01-30)

- Fix CMake project() definition
- shellcheck linting

v0.3.1 (2022-06-28)

- Fix parameter count check in dbt-plot-transaction-distribution

v0.3.0 (2022-05-16)

- Add generic transaction rate plotting script
- Update plot-transaction-distribution script to handle multiple data files

v0.2.0 (2022-04-19)

- Update command line flags in some scripts in effort to make usage more
  uniform
- Create more sar memory charts: kbbuffers, kbcached, and kbdirty
- Enhance pidstat processing
- Fix pidstat chart creation
- Adopt Artistic License 2.0

v0.1.0 (2021-10-27)

- Initial release.
